  "label": "The text 'dirty immigrant scum' is mapped onto the family of five.",
  "description": "The overlaid text 'dirty immigrant scum' directly labels and dehumanizes the visual entity 'family_of_five'. The text explicitly assigns derogatory characteristics (dirty, scum) to the entire family, which is visually depicted as a happy, cohesive unit. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it uses the wholesome image of a family to contrast with the abusive text, thereby vilifying the group it represents (Latino/Hispanic immigrants) through analogical projection. The mapping is established by the spatial adjacency and direct textual reference to the visual group.",
